"Help provided by core <application>GNOME</application> and many of the "
"support applications."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Yelp"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Yelp</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:138
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Still as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, ensure "
"that <filename>/usr/share/applications/mimeinfo.cache</filename> will be "
"updated and therefore the <command>help</command> in gnome applications will"
" work."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>update-desktop-database</userinput>"
msgstr ""

